<p>NOTE: Net income for the nine months ended March 30, 1997, included a charge of $1,280 related to the company's consolidation of operations in the first quarter of the current fiscal year, tax related interest income of $238 and a $342 federal income tax benefit related to a recovery under a tax sharing agreement with QLogic Corp. (a former subsidiary of the company which was spunoff in February 1994).  Excluding these non-recurring items, net of tax, net income would have been $1,245, or 20 cents per share.  Net loss for the nine months ended March 31, 1996, included a $312 gain from the sale of a building at the manufacturing facility in Puerto Rico.</p>
